		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "43eadd66-06c4-41c3-a4ce-c75cb31d83bb")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 340.36 71.12 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "859897ae-f0ad-4d95-b22e-7f0d980ca8bf")
	)
	(text "TOPOLOGY IS NON-INVERTING, unlike the mule's own drive orientation -- see this"
