		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "8e4f7890-0061-475c-afc2-48ca21512338")
	)
	(text "(AV02-0235EN footnote b) and of the 15mA ABSOLUTE maximum. 240R was rejected at"
